  "description_short": "This set includes the six 10, 20 and 50 centime coins, issued in 2023 and 2024, minted in Proof quality. Historically dedicated to the Sower, the three 2024 denominations will honor three exceptional women who have contributed to the elevation of ...",
  "description_detailed": "This set includes the six 10, 20 and 50 centime coins, issued in 2023 and 2024, minted in Proof quality. Historically dedicated to the Sower, the three 2024 denominations will honor three exceptional women who have contributed to the elevation of France and its international influence. The timeless figure of the sower imagined by engraver Oscar Roty will always feature on all three denominations, as a tribute to the euro designs that have accompanied us for over 20 years. Struck in a limited edition of only 2024 copies, this box features the new cents designs which will enter circulation in January 2024. The juxtaposition of the denominations allows us to observe the evolution of the national faces, designed more than 20 years apart by Joaquin Jiménez, Engraver General of the Monnaie de Paris.",
